{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17776","headline":"春日奉献圣寿无疆词十首 三 · 杨巨源","name":"春日奉献圣寿无疆词十首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云陛临黄道，天门在碧虚。\n大明含睿藻，元气抱宸居。\n戈偃征苗後，诗传宴镐初。\n年华富仙苑，时哲满公车。\n化入絪緼大，恩垂涣汗余。\n悠然万方静，风俗揖华胥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17776.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17776","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}